:v4: approver is existing client employee? ({No, Yes}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v4 = 'No'])
:form not authorized by external resource;
else ([v4 = 'Yes'])
:form approved?;
:recruitment manager sends form and other documentation;
:client HR receives form and documentation;
:The HR department scans the completed form and records the position against the stored position in GovSource;
:any variations?;
:v6: any variations? ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v6 = 'Yes'])
:a complete business case is required;
else ([v6 = 'No'])
:Otherwise, the process continues;
endif
endif
